    skos:altLabel "RiskMetric" ;
    skos:altLabel "DegradedSystemCondition" ;
    skos:definition "A RiskInformedAcceptabilityEvaluation functions as a process which takes a RiskMetric into consideration while performing an evaluation of a DegradedSystemCondition. To conduct a RiskInformedAcceptabilityEvaluation, one executes a process that first accounts for a RiskMetric and subsequently assesses a DegradedSystemCondition. A RiskMetric is considered and a DegradedSystemCondition is evaluated within the process designated as a RiskInformedAcceptabilityEvaluation." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

