    skos:definition "A MalnutritionTreatmentProcess is defined as an occurrent that treats a MalnourishedChild and brings about a RecoveredState. When an occurrent functions as a MalnutritionTreatmentProcess, it treats a MalnourishedChild and results in a RecoveredState. The treatment of a MalnourishedChild and the achievement of a RecoveredState are realized by an occurrent classified as a MalnutritionTreatmentProcess." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_HYPOTHESIS_TEST> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Hypothesis Test" ;
    skos:notation "1.37" ;
    skos:altLabel "HYPOTHESIS_TEST" ;
    skos:altLabel "HypothesisTest" ;
    skos:altLabel "TestStatistic" ;
    skos:altLabel "SignificanceLevel" ;
    skos:definition "A HypothesisTest constitutes an occurrent whose operational definition requires evaluating a TestStatistic and applying a SignificanceLevel. The occurrent entity called a HypothesisTest performs two functions: evaluating a TestStatistic and applying a SignificanceLevel. Evaluation of a TestStatistic and application of a SignificanceLevel characterize the occurrent classified as a HypothesisTest." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_STAFF_SOCIAL_MEDIA_ACCOUNT_ADMINISTRATOR_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
