    skos:altLabel "ServiceStaffRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "RestaurantStaff" ;
    skos:altLabel "ServiceProvisionActivity" ;
    skos:definition "{ServiceStaffRole} is a role that has bearer exactly one {RestaurantStaff}, and that is realized in some {ServiceProvisionActivity} Every {ServiceStaffRole} stands in the has bearer relation to exactly one {RestaurantStaff}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {ServiceProvisionActivity}. For an entity to count as {ServiceStaffRole}, it must bear the has bearer relation to exactly one {RestaurantStaff}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {ServiceProvisionActivity}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_FLOOD_ASSET_CONDITION_ASSESSMENT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Flood Asset Condition Assessment" ;
    skos:notation "1.38" ;
    skos:altLabel "FLOOD_ASSET_CONDITION_ASSESSMENT" ;
    skos:altLabel "FloodAssetConditionAssessment" ;
    skos:altLabel "FloodInfrastructure" ;
    skos:altLabel "EarthObservationData" ;
    skos:definition "This class comprises every activity that evaluates flood infrastructure and applies earth observation data. (Definitional) Executing this activity requires evaluating flood infrastructure and applying earth observation data. (Procedural) This activity stands in an assessment relation to flood infrastructure and in a utilization relation to earth observation data. (Relational-fronted)" ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_RECORD_AUTHORIZATION_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Record Authorization Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.24" ;
    skos:altLabel "RECORD_AUTHORIZATION_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "RecordAuthorizationRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "YouthOrGuardian" ;
    skos:altLabel "HealthRecordTransferProcess" ;
    skos:definition "A record authorization role is defined as a role that is borne by exactly one youth or guardian and that realizes in a health record transfer process. A health record transfer process realizes a record authorization role, which is a role borne by exactly one youth or guardian. A record authorization role constitutes a role that is borne by exactly one youth or guardian and realizes within a health record transfer process." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_COMMUNICABLE_DISEASE_NOTIFICATION_REQUIREMENT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Communicable Disease Notification Requirement" ;
    skos:notation "1.39" ;
    skos:altLabel "COMMUNICABLE_DISEASE_NOTIFICATION_REQUIREMENT" ;
    skos:altLabel "CommunicableDiseaseNotificationRequirement" ;
    skos:altLabel "HealthCareSummary" ;
    skos:altLabel "ReceivingFacilityStaff" ;
    skos:definition "A communicable disease notification requirement constitutes a directive ICE that mandates the disclosure of a health care summary and targets receiving facility staff. If a directive ICE functions as a communicable disease notification requirement, it obligates receiving facility staff to disclose a health care summary. The requirement to disclose a health care summary characterizes a communicable disease notification requirement, which is a directive ICE aimed at receiving facility staff." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE_YOUTH_HEALTH_CARE_SUMMARY> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Youth Health Care Summary" ;
    skos:notation "3.1.5" ;
    skos:altLabel "YOUTH_HEALTH_CARE_SUMMARY" ;
    skos:altLabel "YouthHealthCareSummary" ;
    skos:altLabel "YouthHealthStatus" ;
    skos:altLabel "EstablishedDataFormat" ;
    skos:definition "An information content entity that outlines a youth health status and adopts an established data format constitutes a youth health care summary. The youth health status is documented by an information content entity structured as an established data format, which functions as a youth health care summary. A youth health care summary shall operate as an information content entity that records a youth health status and conforms to an established data format." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_MENTORSHIP_PROGRAM> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mentorship Program" ;
    skos:notation "1.40" ;
    skos:altLabel "MENTORSHIP_PROGRAM" ;
    skos:altLabel "MentorshipProgram" ;
    skos:altLabel "ExperiencedMentor" ;
    skos:altLabel "StudentEntrepreneur" ;
    skos:definition "A mentorship program is classified as an occurrent whose defining activities are guiding experienced mentors and coaching student entrepreneurs. A mentorship program functions as an occurrent that guides experienced mentors and coaches student entrepreneurs. (Still too similar) A mentorship program is defined as an occurrent that guides experienced mentors and coaches student entrepreneurs." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_STUDENT_ENTREPRENEUR_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
