    skos:altLabel "LeadershipExperienceRequirement" ;
    skos:definition "A LeadershipExperienceRequirement is defined as a descriptive information entity whose sole specification is a decimal value indicating the minimum years of leadership experience. Exactly one decimal value denoting the minimum years of leadership experience is specified by a LeadershipExperienceRequirement, which functions as a descriptive information entity. A LeadershipExperienceRequirement must comprise a descriptive information entity that asserts precisely one decimal value to denote the minimum years of leadership experience." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

