    skos:altLabel "ProfessionalDevelopmentGoal" ;
    skos:definition "A CMESeminar constitutes an Occurrent that maintains some PracticeManagementTopic as its topic focus and some ProfessionalDevelopmentGoal as its educational goal. In the relational mapping of a CMESeminar, the has_topic_focus property connects to some PracticeManagementTopic and the has_educational_goal property connects to some ProfessionalDevelopmentGoal, within the class of Occurrents. An Occurrent is classified as a CMESeminar when it satisfies the requirements of possessing some PracticeManagementTopic as a topic focus and some ProfessionalDevelopmentGoal as an educational goal." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

