    skos:altLabel "OrganizationalHealthMetric" ;
    skos:definition "A process classified as an EmployeeFeedbackSurvey performs two functions: it measures a WorkplaceCultureDimension and assesses an OrganizationalHealthMetric." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC_WORKPLACE_CULTURE_DIMENSION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Workplace Culture Dimension" ;
    skos:notation "0.3" ;
    skos:altLabel "WORKPLACE_CULTURE_DIMENSION" ;
    skos:altLabel "WorkplaceCultureDimension" ;
    skos:altLabel "CulturalAttribute" ;
    skos:definition "A WorkplaceCultureDimension constitutes a descriptive information entity that categorizes a CulturalAttribute. Categorization of a CulturalAttribute is performed by a WorkplaceCultureDimension, which is a descriptive information entity. A WorkplaceCultureDimension is classified as a descriptive information entity that categorizes a CulturalAttribute." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_TOP_WORKPLACE_AWARD> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Top Workplace Award" ;
    skos:notation "1.63" ;
    skos:altLabel "TOP_WORKPLACE_AWARD" ;
    skos:altLabel "TopWorkplaceAward" ;
    skos:altLabel "RecognizingOrganization" ;
    skos:altLabel "HealthStandardCompliance" ;
    skos:definition "A TopWorkPlaceAward qualifies as a directive information entity that is conferred by a RecognizingOrganization and verifies HealthStandardCompliance. For an entity to be classified as a TopWorkPlaceAward, it must function as a directive information entity awarded by a RecognizingOrganization and verifying HealthStandardCompliance. Every TopWorkPlaceAward serves as a directive information entity that is awarded by a RecognizingOrganization and verifies HealthStandardCompliance." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_B_CORPORATION_MEMBER> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "B Corporation Member" ;
    skos:notation "5.36" ;
    skos:altLabel "B_CORPORATION_MEMBER" ;
    skos:altLabel "BCorporationMember" ;
    skos:definition "A B corporation member denotes a role characterized by the dual capacity to realize a process and to be realized in a process. In relation to a process, a B corporation member acts as a role that realizes that process and is simultaneously realized in that process. A B corporation member occupies the status of a role that realizes a process and is realized in a process." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_TRADITIONAL_RELIGIOUS_HEALER_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Traditional Religious Healer Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.37" ;
    skos:altLabel "TRADITIONAL_RELIGIOUS_HEALER_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "TraditionalReligiousHealerRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "HumanAgent" ;
    skos:altLabel "TraditionalReligiousHealingProcess" ;
    skos:definition "{TraditionalReligiousHealerRole} is a role that is borne by exactly one {HumanAgent}, and that is realized in some {TraditionalReligiousHealingProcess} For an entity to count as {TraditionalReligiousHealerRole}, it must bear the is borne by relation to exactly one {HumanAgent}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {TraditionalReligiousHealingProcess}. Each {TraditionalReligiousHealerRole} is defined as a role which is borne by exactly one {HumanAgent}, and which is realized in some {TraditionalReligiousHealingProcess}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_RITUAL_ACT_TO_RESTORE_ORDER> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ritual Act To Restore Order" ;
    skos:notation "1.64" ;
    skos:altLabel "RITUAL_ACT_TO_RESTORE_ORDER" ;
    skos:altLabel "RitualActToRestoreOrder" ;
    skos:altLabel "SacredArtifact" ;
    skos:altLabel "SocialHarmonyRestoration" ;
    skos:definition "The definition of a RitualActToRestoreOrder specifies a BFO process that necessarily encompasses at least one SacredArtifact and targets a SocialHarmonyRestoration state. When a BFO process is instantiated as a RitualActToRestoreOrder, it necessarily engages at least one SacredArtifact while proceeding toward a SocialHarmonyRestoration state. A RitualActToRestoreOrder must satisfy the structural requirements of a BFO process by incorporating at least one SacredArtifact and directing its course toward a SocialHarmonyRestoration state." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_ANCESTOR_VENERATION_CEREMONY> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ancestor Veneration Ceremony" ;
    skos:notation "1.65" ;
    skos:altLabel "ANCESTOR_VENERATION_CEREMONY" ;
    skos:altLabel "AncestorVenerationCeremony" ;
    skos:altLabel "AncestralSpiritCommunity" ;
    skos:definition "An AncestorVenerationCeremony constitutes a BFO process that takes part within an AncestralSpiritCommunity. Participation in an AncestralSpiritCommunity characterizes a BFO process classified as an AncestorVenerationCeremony. Any BFO process identified as an AncestorVenerationCeremony must participate in an AncestralSpiritCommunity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_DISABLED_ADULT_PARENT_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Disabled Adult Parent Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.38" ;
    skos:altLabel "DISABLED_ADULT_PARENT_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "DisabledAdultParentRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "Adult" ;
    skos:altLabel "ParentingProcess" ;
    skos:definition "{DisabledAdultParentRole} is a role that is borne by exactly one {Adult}, and that is realized in some {ParentingProcess} As a role, {DisabledAdultParentRole} is characterised by the is borne by relation to exactly one {Adult}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {ParentingProcess}. Each {DisabledAdultParentRole} is defined as a role which is borne by exactly one {Adult}, and which is realized in some {ParentingProcess}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_MUNICIPAL_SWIMMING_POOL_ASSISTANT_MANAGER> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Municipal Swimming Pool Assistant Manager" ;
    skos:notation "5.39" ;
    skos:altLabel "MUNICIPAL_SWIMMING_POOL_ASSISTANT_MANAGER" ;
    skos:altLabel "MunicipalSwimmingPoolAssistantManager" ;
    skos:altLabel "HumanAgent" ;
    skos:altLabel "MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity" ;
    skos:definition "{MunicipalSwimmingPoolAssistantManager} is a role that inheres in exactly one {HumanAgent}, and that is realized in some {MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity} For an entity to count as {MunicipalSwimmingPoolAssistantManager}, it must bear the inheres in relation to exactly one {HumanAgent}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity}. Every {MunicipalSwimmingPoolAssistantManager} stands in the inheres in relation to exactly one {HumanAgent}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_MUNICIPAL_POOL_OPERATIONS_MANAGEMENT_ACTIVITY> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Municipal Pool Operations Management Activity" ;
    skos:notation "1.66" ;
    skos:altLabel "MUNICIPAL_POOL_OPERATIONS_MANAGEMENT_ACTIVITY" ;
    skos:altLabel "MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity" ;
    skos:altLabel "LifeguardStaff" ;
    skos:altLabel "MunicipalPoolFacility" ;
    skos:definition "A process classified as a MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity is definitionaly characterized by the requirement that at least one LifeguardStaff participates and at least one MunicipalPoolFacility serves as its object. (A bit clunky) A MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity is defined as a process that necessarily includes at least one LifeguardStaff participant and at least one MunicipalPoolFacility object. Every MunicipalPoolOperationsManagementActivity stands in the involves_participant relation to at least one LifeguardStaff and in the involves_object relation to at least one MunicipalPoolFacility." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_WATER_QUALITY_MONITORING_ACTIVITY> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Water Quality Monitoring Activity" ;
    skos:notation "1.67" ;
    skos:altLabel "WATER_QUALITY_MONITORING_ACTIVITY" ;
    skos:altLabel "WaterQualityMonitoringActivity" ;
    skos:altLabel "DepartmentOfHealthStandard" ;
    skos:altLabel "PoolWaterQualityParameter" ;
    skos:definition "Every WaterQualityMonitoringActivity is a process that necessarily employs a DepartmentOfHealthStandard and evaluates a PoolWaterQualityParameter. A process must utilize a DepartmentOfHealthStandard and assess a PoolWaterQualityParameter in order to be classified as a WaterQualityMonitoringActivity. The use of a DepartmentOfHealthStandard and the measurement of a PoolWaterQualityParameter are mandatory attributes for any process defined as a WaterQualityMonitoringActivity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE_THERMAL_OPERATING_RANGE_CONSTRAINT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Thermal Operating Range Constraint" ;
    skos:notation "3.1.11" ;
    skos:altLabel "THERMAL_OPERATING_RANGE_CONSTRAINT" ;
    skos:altLabel "ThermalOperatingRangeConstraint" ;
    skos:definition "A ThermalOperatingRangeConstraint constitutes a descriptive information entity that defines a minimum and a maximum temperature threshold required for safe operation. The definition of a lower and an upper temperature limit for safe operation is provided by a ThermalOperatingRangeConstraint, classified as a descriptive information entity. A lower and upper temperature limit for safe operation is specified by a ThermalOperatingRangeConstraint, which is a descriptive information entity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_ATTENDANCE_TRACKING_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attendance Tracking Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.68" ;
    skos:altLabel "ATTENDANCE_TRACKING_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "AttendanceTrackingProcess" ;
    skos:altLabel "StudentEntity" ;
    skos:altLabel "AttendanceRecord" ;
    skos:definition "An AttendanceTrackingProcess is a process that participates in some StudentEntity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_EDUCATIONAL_COURSE> a skos:Concept ;
