    skos:definition "An ExecutiveOfficerRole is a role borne by exactly one CorporateAgent that realizes an ExecutiveExecutionFunction." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_BOARD_OF_AUDITORS_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Board Of Auditors Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.43" ;
    skos:altLabel "BOARD_OF_AUDITORS_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "BoardOfAuditorsRole" ;
    skos:definition "A board of auditors role constitutes a role that both occurs within a process and brings about a process. A process realizes a board of auditors role, and that same board of auditors role realizes a process. When a board of auditors role is instantiated, it must be realized in a process and must realize a process." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_MANAGEMENT_MEETING_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Management Meeting Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.70" ;
    skos:altLabel "MANAGEMENT_MEETING_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "ManagementMeetingProcess" ;
    skos:altLabel "CorporateAgent" ;
    skos:altLabel "BusinessDecision" ;
    skos:definition "A ManagementMeetingProcess is defined as an occurrent that encompasses CorporateAgents and yields BusinessDecisions. CorporateAgents are involved in, and BusinessDecisions are produced by, every occurrent classified as a ManagementMeetingProcess. When a ManagementMeetingProcess unfolds as an occurrent, it engages CorporateAgents and results in BusinessDecisions." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_INDEPENDENT_CONTINUANT_INTERNAL_AUDITING_DIVISION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Internal Auditing Division" ;
    skos:notation "2.6" ;
    skos:altLabel "INTERNAL_AUDITING_DIVISION" ;
    skos:altLabel "InternalAuditingDivision" ;
    skos:altLabel "CertifiedInternalAuditor" ;
    skos:altLabel "InternalAuditingFunction" ;
    skos:definition "An InternalAuditingDivision is a material entity that has a CertifiedInternalAuditor as a direct part." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_INDEPENDENT_CONTINUANT> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_FINE_ASSESSMENT_EVENT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fine Assessment Event" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.25" ;
    skos:altLabel "FINE_ASSESSMENT_EVENT" ;
    skos:altLabel "FineAssessmentEvent" ;
    skos:altLabel "PropertyOwner" ;
    skos:altLabel "PolicyViolation" ;
    skos:definition "A FineAssessmentEvent is classified as an InformationContentEntity that carries an assessesOwner link to a PropertyOwner, an addressesViolation link to a PolicyViolation, and a has assessmentAmount link to an xsd:decimal. Any FineAssessmentEvent must exist as an InformationContentEntity that simultaneously satisfies the requirements of relating to at least one PropertyOwner through assessesOwner, to at least one PolicyViolation through addressesViolation, and to at least one xsd:decimal through has assessmentAmount." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_INSPECTION_REPORT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Inspection Report" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.26" ;
    skos:altLabel "INSPECTION_REPORT" ;
    skos:altLabel "InspectionReport" ;
    skos:altLabel "InspectionEvent" ;
    skos:definition "An inspection report qualifies as an information content entity precisely because it documents an InspectionEvent. The documentation of an InspectionEvent defines an inspection report as an information content entity. An inspection report assumes the role of an information content entity through its documentation of an InspectionEvent." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC_SECRETARY_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Secretary Role" ;
    skos:notation "0.4" ;
    skos:altLabel "SECRETARY_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "SecretaryRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "StateGovernment" ;
    skos:altLabel "LegislativeDepartment" ;
    skos:definition "A role possessing a specific organizational affiliation is defined as one that is realized within a state government that realizes a process. The realization of a role with a specific organizational affiliation takes place in a state government that realizes a process. A state government that realizes a process hosts" ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_INDEPENDENT_CONTINUANT_EMERGENCY_SUPPLIES_KIT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Emergency Supplies Kit" ;
    skos:notation "2.7" ;
    skos:altLabel "EMERGENCY_SUPPLIES_KIT" ;
    skos:altLabel "EmergencySuppliesKit" ;
    skos:altLabel "DisasterSupplyItem" ;
    skos:altLabel "EmergencyResponse" ;
    skos:definition "The structural composition of an EmergencySuppliesKit necessarily incorporates a DisasterSupplyItem within an artifact framework. An EmergencySuppliesKit is an artifact defined by its inclusion of a DisasterSupplyItem. A DisasterSupplyItem is held within an artifact that is classified as an EmergencySuppliesKit." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_INDEPENDENT_CONTINUANT> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DIRECTIVE_EVACUATION_INSTRUCTION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Evacuation Instruction" ;
    skos:notation "3.2.2" ;
    skos:altLabel "EVACUATION_INSTRUCTION" ;
    skos:altLabel "EvacuationInstruction" ;
    skos:altLabel "HazardEvent" ;
    skos:altLabel "LocalAuthority" ;
    skos:definition "An EvacuationInstruction is an information content entity that describes a HazardEvent and is issued by a LocalAuthority." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DIRECTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_RESEARCH_MANAGEMENT_ACTIVITY> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Research Management Activity" ;
    skos:notation "1.71" ;
    skos:altLabel "RESEARCH_MANAGEMENT_ACTIVITY" ;
    skos:altLabel "ResearchManagementActivity" ;
    skos:altLabel "ResearchProject" ;
    skos:altLabel "AcademicAgent" ;
    skos:definition "A ResearchManagementActivity is defined as an occurrent that necessarily involves a ResearchProject together with an AcademicAgent. The relational composition of an occurrent that involves a ResearchProject and an AcademicAgent identifies it as a ResearchManagementActivity. An occurrent functions as a ResearchManagementActivity solely when it engages a ResearchProject and an AcademicAgent." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_DDOS_MITIGATION_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ddos Mitigation Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.72" ;
    skos:altLabel "DDOS_MITIGATION_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "DdosMitigationProcess" ;
    skos:altLabel "DdosAttackEvent" ;
    skos:altLabel "NetworkInfrastructure" ;
    skos:definition "A DdosMitigationProcess is classified as a Process that contains at least one hasTriggeringAttack directed toward a DdosAttackEvent and at least one hasProtectedInfrastructure directed toward a NetworkInfrastructure. The hasTriggeringAttack relation links a DdosMitigationProcess to some DdosAttackEvent, and the hasProtectedInfrastructure relation links it to some NetworkInfrastructure, establishing it as a Process. Any entity designated as a DdosMitigationProcess must satisfy the Process type while maintaining a hasTriggeringAttack connection to a DdosAttackEvent and a hasProtectedInfrastructure connection to a NetworkInfrastructure." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_CLEAN_TRAFFIC_REDIRECTION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Clean Traffic Redirection" ;
    skos:notation "1.73" ;
    skos:altLabel "CLEAN_TRAFFIC_REDIRECTION" ;
    skos:altLabel "CleanTrafficRedirection" ;
    skos:altLabel "NetworkScrubbingCenter" ;
    skos:altLabel "CustomerNetwork" ;
    skos:altLabel "ScrubbingActivity" ;
    skos:definition "Clean traffic redirection constitutes a process defined by its origin at a network scrubbing center, its delivery to a customer network, and its realization within a scrubbing activity. The process of clean traffic redirection begins at a network scrubbing center, proceeds to deliver traffic to a customer network, and culminates in a scrubbing activity. Clean traffic redirection is classified as a process characterized by its origin at a network scrubbing center, its delivery to a customer network, and its realization within a scrubbing activity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_ENTREPRENEUR_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Entrepreneur Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.44" ;
    skos:altLabel "ENTREPRENEUR_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "EntrepreneurRole" ;
