    skos:altLabel "NutritionalStatusIndicator" ;
    skos:altLabel "QuantitativeMeasurement" ;
    skos:definition "The expressing relation for a NutritionalStatusIndicator, which is a type of DescriptiveICE, connects to some QuantitativeMeasurement and connects solely to QuantitativeMeasurements. Every NutritionalStatusIndicator, being a DescriptiveICE, expresses some QuantitativeMeasurement and expresses only QuantitativeMeasurements. (Too similar to original)" ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_INFORMED_CONSENT_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Informed Consent Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.86" ;
    skos:altLabel "INFORMED_CONSENT_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "InformedConsentProcess" ;
    skos:altLabel "ParticipantInteraction" ;
    skos:altLabel "EthicalRequirement" ;
    skos:definition "Every InformedConsentProcess belongs to the class of Process, and necessarily involves some ParticipantInteraction while satisfying some EthicalRequirement. (Definitional) The execution of an InformedConsentProcess requires that the underlying Process engages some ParticipantInteraction and complies An InformedConsentProcess constitutes a Process that incorporates a ParticipantInteraction and fulfills an EthicalRequirement." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_BOARD_MEMBER_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Board Member Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.50" ;
    skos:altLabel "BOARD_MEMBER_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "BoardMemberRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "IndependentContinuant" ;
    skos:altLabel "BoardMemberRoleRealization" ;
    skos:definition "{BoardMemberRole} is a role that has borne agent exactly one {IndependentContinuant}, and that is realized in some {BoardMemberRoleRealization} As a role, {BoardMemberRole} is characterised by the has borne agent relation to exactly one {IndependentContinuant}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {BoardMemberRoleRealization}. For an entity to count as {BoardMemberRole}, it must bear the has borne agent relation to exactly one {IndependentContinuant}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {BoardMemberRoleRealization}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_PROPERTY_ASSESSMENT_NOTICE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Property Assessment Notice" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.34" ;
    skos:altLabel "PROPERTY_ASSESSMENT_NOTICE" ;
    skos:altLabel "PropertyAssessmentNotice" ;
    skos:altLabel "ApprovalRecommendation" ;
    skos:definition "An information content entity functions as a property assessment notice when it is submitted for approval of a recommendation. Submission for approval of a recommendation characterizes an information content entity that constitutes a property assessment notice. The classification of a property assessment notice falls within information content entities that are submitted for approval of a recommendation." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_ANIMAL_CONTROL_OFFICER_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Animal Control Officer Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.51" ;
    skos:altLabel "ANIMAL_CONTROL_OFFICER_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "AnimalControlOfficerRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "HumanAgent" ;
    skos:altLabel "AnimalEnforcementActivity" ;
    skos:definition "An AnimalControlOfficerRole denotes a role held by precisely one HumanAgent that instantiates at least one AnimalEnforcementActivity. When a HumanAgent occupies an AnimalControlOfficerRole, that role is assigned to exactly one such agent and brings into being some AnimalEnforcementActivity. Relationally, an AnimalControlOfficerRole stands in a bearing relationship with exactly one HumanAgent and in a realization relationship with some AnimalEnforcementActivity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_ELIGIBLE_RAFFLE_CONDUCTOR_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Eligible Raffle Conductor Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.52" ;
    skos:altLabel "ELIGIBLE_RAFFLE_CONDUCTOR_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "EligibleRaffleConductorRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "NonprofitOrganization" ;
    skos:altLabel "RaffleConductingActivity" ;
    skos:definition "{EligibleRaffleConductorRole} is a role that inheres in exactly one {NonprofitOrganization}, and that is realized in some {RaffleConductingActivity} As a role, {EligibleRaffleConductorRole} is characterised by the inheres in relation to exactly one {NonprofitOrganization}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {RaffleConductingActivity}. Every {EligibleRaffleConductorRole} stands in the inheres in relation to exactly one {NonprofitOrganization}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {RaffleConductingActivity}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_DATA_EXPORT_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Data Export Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.87" ;
    skos:altLabel "DATA_EXPORT_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "DataExportProcess" ;
    skos:altLabel "ExportedDataArtifact" ;
    skos:altLabel "SoftwareInterface" ;
    skos:definition "DataExportProcess denotes a process whose function is to produce ExportedDataArtifact through the use of SoftwareInterface. When SoftwareInterface is employed, a DataExportProcess generates ExportedDataArtifact. ExportedDataArtifact is generated by a DataExportProcess through SoftwareInterface." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_PATIENT_EDUCATIONAL_CONTENT_PACKAGE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Patient Educational Content Package" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.35" ;
    skos:altLabel "PATIENT_EDUCATIONAL_CONTENT_PACKAGE" ;
    skos:altLabel "PatientEducationalContentPackage" ;
    skos:altLabel "MedicationFactSheet" ;
    skos:altLabel "PatientEducationPurpose" ;
    skos:definition "The aggregation of medication fact sheets for patient education comprises a collection of information content entities." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE_OBSERVATORY_MOUNTING_CONFIGURATION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Observatory Mounting Configuration" ;
    skos:notation "3.1.16" ;
    skos:altLabel "OBSERVATORY_MOUNTING_CONFIGURATION" ;
    skos:altLabel "ObservatoryMountingConfiguration" ;
    skos:altLabel "TelescopeInstrumentArtifact" ;
    skos:altLabel "ObservatoryMountingStructure" ;
    skos:definition "An information content entity designated as an ObservatoryMountingConfiguration defines exactly one TelescopeInstrumentArtifact that is allocated to exactly one ObservatoryMountingStructure. Exactly one TelescopeInstrumentArtifact allocated to exactly one ObservatoryMountingStructure is specified by an ObservatoryMountingConfiguration, which functions as an information content entity. The ObservatoryMountingConfiguration operates as an information content entity that mandates exactly one TelescopeInstrumentArtifact be allocated to exactly one ObservatoryMountingStructure. -> \"mandates" ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_TELEMARKETER_SALES_ADMINISTRATOR_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Telemarketer Sales Administrator Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.53" ;
    skos:altLabel "TELEMARKETER_SALES_ADMINISTRATOR_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "Person" ;
    skos:altLabel "SalesAdministrationActivity" ;
    skos:definition "{TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole} is a role that inheres in exactly one {Person}, and that is realized in some {SalesAdministrationActivity} Each {TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole} is defined as a role which inheres in exactly one {Person}, and which is realized in some {SalesAdministrationActivity}. For an entity to count as {TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole}, it must bear the inheres in relation to exactly one {Person}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {SalesAdministrationActivity}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_TELEMARKETING_KPI_CONSTRAINT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Telemarketing K P I Constraint" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.36" ;
    skos:altLabel "TELEMARKETING_KPI_CONSTRAINT" ;
    skos:altLabel "TelemarketingKPIConstraint" ;
    skos:altLabel "TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "CallVolumeMetric" ;
    skos:definition "A TelemarketingKPIConstraint is classified as an InformationContentEntity that applies to some TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole, measures some CallVolumeMetric, and specifies a minimumCallsPerHour of type xsd:decimal. The defining relations for a TelemarketingKPIConstraint (an InformationContentEntity) are application to some TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole, measurement of some CallVolumeMetric, and specification of a minimumCallsPerHour of type xsd:decimal. An InformationContentEntity constitutes a TelemarketingKPIConstraint when it applies to some TelemarketerSalesAdministratorRole, measures some CallVolumeMetric, and specifies a minimumCallsPerHour of type xsd:decimal." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_WEEKLY_SALES_REPORT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Weekly Sales Report" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.37" ;
    skos:altLabel "WEEKLY_SALES_REPORT" ;
    skos:altLabel "WeeklySalesReport" ;
    skos:altLabel "TeleSalesActivity" ;
    skos:altLabel "ReportingPeriod" ;
    skos:altLabel "WeeklyPeriod" ;
    skos:definition "An instance of WeeklySalesReport constitutes an InformationContentEntity that bears a describing relation to at least one TeleSalesActivity and occupies a situated_in relation with at least one ReportingPeriod. When an InformationContentEntity describes a TeleSalesActivity and is situated_in a ReportingPeriod, it functions as a WeeklySalesReport. The describing of some TeleSalesActivity and the situated_in relation to some ReportingPeriod are both properties held by every WeeklySalesReport, which itself classifies as an InformationContentEntity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_CLEARING_BROKER_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Clearing Broker Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.54" ;
    skos:altLabel "CLEARING_BROKER_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "ClearingBrokerRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "CustomerAccount" ;
    skos:altLabel "ClearingBrokerServiceDeliveryProcess" ;
    skos:definition "{ClearingBrokerRole} is a role that inheres in exactly one {CustomerAccount}, and that is realized in some {ClearingBrokerServiceDeliveryProcess} Each {ClearingBrokerRole} is defined as a role which inheres in exactly one {CustomerAccount}, and which is realized in some {ClearingBrokerServiceDeliveryProcess}. Every {ClearingBrokerRole} stands in the inheres in relation to exactly one {CustomerAccount}, and the is realized in relation to at least one {ClearingBrokerServiceDeliveryProcess}." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_INDEPENDENT_CONTINUANT_SECURITY_INFRASTRUCTURE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Security Infrastructure" ;
    skos:notation "2.10" ;
    skos:altLabel "SECURITY_INFRASTRUCTURE" ;
    skos:altLabel "SecurityInfrastructure" ;
    skos:altLabel "AccessControlMechanism" ;
    skos:definition "A specific continuant qualifies as security infrastructure precisely when it contains at least one access control mechanism as a direct part. When an access control mechanism functions as a direct part of a specific continuant, that continuant constitutes security infrastructure." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_INDEPENDENT_CONTINUANT> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DUPLICATING_REQUEST> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Duplicating Request" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.38" ;
    skos:altLabel "DUPLICATING_REQUEST" ;
    skos:altLabel "DuplicatingRequest" ;
    skos:altLabel "RequestingEntity" ;
    skos:altLabel "ont00000253" ;
    skos:definition "A duplicating request is constituted by a requester, a turnaround time, and a document that is a material entity. A requester, a turnaround time, and a document that is a material entity are each associated with a duplicating request." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_MAIL_DISPATCH_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mail Dispatch Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.88" ;
    skos:altLabel "MAIL_DISPATCH_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "MailDispatchProcess" ;
    skos:altLabel "MailDropLocation" ;
    skos:altLabel "DepartmentalSortingRule" ;
    skos:definition "A MailDispatchProcess is a Process that is linked via hasDestinationLocation to at least one MailDropLocation and via hasSortingCriteria to at least one DepartmentalSortingRule. (Definitional) The hasDestinationLocation property attaches a MailDropLocation to a MailDispatchProcess, which itself is classified as a Process, and the hasSortingCriteria property attaches a DepartmentalSortingRule to that same Process. (Relational-fronted) A MailDispatchProcess is defined as a Process instance that includes at least one MailDropLocation linked by hasDestinationLocation and at least one DepartmentalSortingRule linked by hasSortingCriteria." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE_REFERRAL_SOURCE_ROLE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Referral Source Role" ;
    skos:notation "5.55" ;
    skos:altLabel "REFERRAL_SOURCE_ROLE" ;
    skos:altLabel "ReferralSourceRole" ;
    skos:altLabel "CriminalJusticeSystem" ;
    skos:altLabel "ReferralProcess" ;
    skos:definition "ReferralSourceRole is a role borne by exactly one CriminalJusticeSystem and realizes some ReferralProcess." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ROLE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_SURVEY_FINDING> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Survey Finding" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.39" ;
    skos:altLabel "SURVEY_FINDING" ;
    skos:altLabel "SurveyFinding" ;
    skos:altLabel "SubstanceType" ;
    skos:altLabel "PrevalenceRate" ;
    skos:definition "An instance of SurveyFinding constitutes an information entity that includes a SubstanceType, a PrevalenceRate, and a percentage value. The relations involving a SubstanceType and a PrevalenceRate, alongside the possession of a percentage value, characterize an information entity classified as SurveyFinding. For an information entity to qualify as a SurveyFinding, it must contain a SubstanceType, a PrevalenceRate, and a percentage value." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC_VEHICLE_POWER_TYPE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Vehicle Power Type" ;
    skos:notation "0.5" ;
    skos:altLabel "VEHICLE_POWER_TYPE" ;
    skos:altLabel "VehiclePowerType" ;
    skos:altLabel "DieselPoweredVehicle" ;
    skos:altLabel "NonDieselPoweredVehicle" ;
    skos:definition "The definition of a vehicle power type comprises exactly the two forms: a diesel powered vehicle or a non diesel powered vehicle. When categorizing a vehicle power type, assign it to the diesel powered vehicle class or the non diesel powered vehicle class, as these two categories exhaust the concept. A vehicle power type is restricted to being either a diesel powered vehicle or a non diesel powered vehicle, with no other classifications permitted." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_BREEDING_PROGRAM_APPLICATION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Breeding Program Application" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.40" ;
    skos:altLabel "BREEDING_PROGRAM_APPLICATION" ;
    skos:altLabel "BreedingProgramApplication" ;
    skos:altLabel "HorseIdentity" ;
    skos:definition "A BreedingProgramApplication is an InformationContentEntity that contains a FormSection and identifies a HorseIdentity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_MEASUREMENT_CAPABILITY_PROFILE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Measurement Capability Profile" ;
    skos:notation "3.0.41" ;
    skos:altLabel "MEASUREMENT_CAPABILITY_PROFILE" ;
    skos:altLabel "MeasurementCapabilityProfile" ;
    skos:altLabel "MeasurementParameter" ;
    skos:altLabel "MeasurementRange" ;
    skos:definition "A MeasurementCapabilityProfile constitutes an InformationContentEntity that includes at least one measurement_parameter belonging to MeasurementParameter, at least one measurement_range belonging to MeasurementRange, and at least one expanded_uncertainty_value belonging to Decimal. The measurement_parameter, measurement_range, and expanded_uncertainty_value relations of any MeasurementCapabilityProfile must respectively connect to at least one MeasurementParameter, at least one MeasurementRange, and at least one Decimal, while the profile itself remains an InformationContentEntity. Every instance classified as a MeasurementCapabilityProfile shall be recognized as an InformationContentEntity that maintains a measurement_parameter linked to a MeasurementParameter, a measurement_range linked to a MeasurementRange, and an expanded_uncertainty_value linked to a Decimal." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_DEBT_CASEWORK_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Debt Casework Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.89" ;
    skos:altLabel "DEBT_CASEWORK_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "DebtCaseworkProcess" ;
    skos:altLabel "HousingClient" ;
    skos:altLabel "HousingDebtIssue" ;
    skos:definition "A debt casework process is a process that targets a housing client and addresses a housing debt issue." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DIRECTIVE_HOUSING_POLICY_INFORMATION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Housing Policy Information" ;
    skos:notation "3.2.3" ;
    skos:altLabel "HOUSING_POLICY_INFORMATION" ;
    skos:altLabel "HousingPolicyInformation" ;
    skos:altLabel "HousingPolicyTopic" ;
    skos:definition "Housing policy information is defined as an information content entity whose scope is limited to a housing policy topic. The concern for a housing policy topic characterizes housing policy information as a type of information content entity. Any housing policy information must function as an information content entity that concerns a housing policy topic." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DIRECTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_BUSINESS_ACTIVITY_PROCESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Business Activity Process" ;
    skos:notation "1.90" ;
    skos:altLabel "BUSINESS_ACTIVITY_PROCESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "BusinessActivityProcess" ;
    skos:definition "A process is characterized by involving a business entity as an object. A business entity serves as an object that a process involves. The involvement of a business entity as an object defines a process." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_BUSINESS_DECISION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Business Decision" ;
    skos:notation "1.91" ;
    skos:altLabel "BUSINESS_DECISION" ;
    skos:altLabel "business decision process" ;
    skos:altLabel "decision entity" ;
    skos:altLabel "business choice process" ;
    skos:altLabel "corporate decision process" ;
    skos:definition "A planned process that involves a business entity as its object. This entity represents a decision-making event focused on a business entity. The entity executes the cognitive or procedural steps that result in a choice regarding the business entity. A planned process is defined as a process that takes a business entity as its object. A business entity serves as the object for a planned process that involves it. A planned process that involves a business entity as its object. This entity represents a decision-making event focused on a business entity." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_MATERIAL_ENTITY_BUSINESS_ENTITY> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Business Entity" ;
    skos:notation "2.2.3" ;
    skos:altLabel "BUSINESS_ENTITY" ;
    skos:altLabel "Business Entity" ;
    skos:altLabel "Commercial Entity" ;
    skos:altLabel "Business Organization" ;
    skos:altLabel "Commercial Organization" ;
    skos:definition "A business entity is a material entity that is involved in a business activity process. This entity engages in commercial activities and manages business resources. The entity operates within markets to deliver goods or services. A material entity is defined as an entity that takes part in a business activity process. Involvement in a business activity process is the defining characteristic of a material entity. A business entity is a material entity that is involved in a business activity process. This entity engages in commercial activities." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_MATERIAL_ENTITY> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_BUSINESS_INITIATIVE> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Business Initiative" ;
    skos:notation "1.92" ;
    skos:altLabel "BUSINESS_INITIATIVE" ;
    skos:altLabel "Business Strategic Initiative" ;
    skos:altLabel "Corporate Strategic Initiative" ;
    skos:altLabel "Business Planning Process" ;
    skos:altLabel "Corporate Planning Process" ;
    skos:altLabel "Business Development Initiative" ;
    skos:altLabel "Corporate Development Initiative" ;
    skos:definition "This term identifies a planned business process that involves a business entity as its primary object of execution and strategic focus. Practitioners use this label when documenting corporate expansion programs, product launch strategies, market penetration campaigns, or organizational restructuring efforts that engage business entities to achieve measurable commercial objectives. A planned process is defined as a process that involves a business entity as its object. A business entity serves as the object of a planned process that involves it. A planned business process that involves a business entity as its primary object of execution." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE_CALENDAR_PRODUCT_SPECIFICATION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Calendar Product Specification" ;
    skos:notation "3.1.17" ;
    skos:altLabel "CALENDAR_PRODUCT_SPECIFICATION" ;
    skos:altLabel "Calendar System Spec" ;
    skos:altLabel "Calendar Product Spec" ;
    skos:altLabel "Product Calendar Spec" ;
    skos:altLabel "Calendar System Definition" ;
    skos:definition "This term captures the complete set of specifications, parameters, and functional descriptions that define a particular calendar product. It encompasses the detailed rules, interface requirements, and synchronization protocols that developers use to build and deploy the calendar application. Used when documenting the functional requirements, release schedule, or feature set for a specific calendar software application or digital scheduling tool." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE_CALL_VOLUME_METRIC> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Call Volume Metric" ;
    skos:notation "3.1.18" ;
    skos:altLabel "CALL_VOLUME_METRIC" ;
    skos:altLabel "Call Volume Metric" ;
    skos:altLabel "Call Volume Measure" ;
    skos:altLabel "Call Count Metric" ;
    skos:altLabel "Call Volume Indicator" ;
    skos:altLabel "Call Volume KPI" ;
    skos:definition "A measurement unit of volume that measures call volume. This term applies when tracking the quantity of telephone or communication interactions within a specific timeframe, used to assess operational capacity and demand. A measurement unit of volume is defined as a unit that measures call volume. Call volume is measured by a measurement unit of volume. Tracks the volume of calls received or made. Used to monitor call center performance." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_MATERIAL_ENTITY_CANCER_PATIENT> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cancer Patient" ;
