    skos:altLabel "prosthetic lateral strap" ;
    skos:altLabel "stabilizing strap component" ;
    skos:altLabel "lateral support strap" ;
    skos:altLabel "prosthetic restraint component" ;
    skos:definition "A prosthetic component designed to provide lateral restraint and stabilization during use. This material entity attaches to the prosthetic device to maintain alignment and prevent unwanted side-to-side movement of the residual limb or socket. The strap ensures secure positioning and enhances user comfort through targeted lateral support. A prosthetic component is defined as a device designed to provide lateral restraint and stabilization during use. During use, a prosthetic component operates to provide lateral restraint and stabilization. A prosthetic component designed to provide lateral restraint and stabilization during use. This material entity attaches to the prosthetic device to maintain alignment and prevent unwanted side-to-side movement of the residual limb or socket." ;
