    skos:altLabel "marital status" ;
    skos:altLabel "marital relationship condition" ;
    skos:definition "A constituent state that indicates the marital condition of a person. This term represents the formal status of being married or in a recognized union. A constituent state is defined as a condition that indicates the marital condition of a person. The marital condition of a person is indicated by a constituent state. A constituent state that indicates the marital condition of a person. This state captures the formal relationship status between individuals in a marriage." ;
