    skos:altLabel "Social welfare department" ;
    skos:altLabel "Social services agency" ;
    skos:definition "This term identifies a government organization tasked with administering social services to the public. It encompasses agencies that manage welfare programs, support services, and community assistance initiatives. A government organization that administers social services denotes a governmental entity that administers social services. Social services are administered by a government organization that administers social services. Use this term for government organizations responsible for administering social services. It applies to administrative bodies managing social welfare, not to legislative departments, social networking services, or membership transfer requests." ;
