    skos:altLabel "data export interface" ;
    skos:altLabel "system integration interface" ;
    skos:altLabel "export interface" ;
    skos:altLabel "data transfer interface" ;
    skos:definition "A generically dependent continuant that enables data export to a database. This interface facilitates the structured transmission of information from the software system to external storage locations. It provides the necessary protocols and mappings to ensure accurate data transfer and integration with target database systems. A generically dependent continuant is defined as an entity that enables data export to a database. Data export to a database is enabled by a generically dependent continuant. A generically dependent continuant that enables data export to a database. This interface facilitates the structured transmission of information from the software system to external storage locations." ;
