    skos:altLabel "Taxi Travel Activity" ;
    skos:altLabel "Taxi Vehicle Use Process" ;
    skos:altLabel "Taxi Ride Execution" ;
    skos:definition "An act of travel that involves the use of a vehicle for passenger transport. The taxi ride process encompasses the sequence from passenger boarding to destination arrival, utilizing the taxi vehicle for the journey. This act of travel involves the use of a vehicle for passenger transport where the taxi ride process participates in the broader travel activity. The process applies in urban transportation, ride-sharing, and taxi services where passengers are transported via taxi." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_DISPOSITION_TEAM_FUNCTION> a skos:Concept ;
