    skos:definition "A Team Function is the specific role or activity performed by a crew or team organization. This function contributes to the overall objectives of the team. The activity is realized through the coordinated efforts of team members. A Team Function describes the specific role or activity performed by a crew or team organization. This function contributes to the overall objectives of the team. The activity is realized through the coordinated efforts of team members." ;
