    skos:altLabel "Phone Sales Activity" ;
    skos:altLabel "Telecommunication Sales Process" ;
    skos:altLabel "Call Center Sales Activity" ;
    skos:definition "A process entity executing commercial transactions through telephone communication medium. This activity encompasses sales representatives conducting product presentations, order processing, and customer negotiations using telephone networks. The process involves direct verbal communication between sales personnel and potential customers through telecommunication infrastructure. A process is defined by its execution of sales activities through telephone communication. Telephone communication functions as the channel through which a process carries out sales activities. Applies to commercial sales processes conducted through telephone communication channels. This term covers sales interactions initiated or completed via telephone networks including outbound calling campaigns and inbound sales calls." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_MATERIAL_ENTITY_TELESCOPE_INSTRUMENT_ARTIFACT> a skos:Concept ;
