    skos:altLabel "Telescope Equipment" ;
    skos:altLabel "Telescope System" ;
    skos:definition "A telescope instrument artifact is functionally configured for astronomical observation to capture and analyze celestial phenomena. This telescope artifact maintains optical components, mounting systems, and detection instruments that enable precise astronomical measurements and facilitate scientific research through systematic observation capabilities. A telescope artifact is defined as an entity functionally configured for astronomical observation. The functional configuration of a telescope artifact is directed toward astronomical observation. Telescope artifacts functionally configured for astronomical observation to capture and analyze celestial phenomena." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_MATERIAL_ENTITY> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESCRIPTIVE_TEST_STATISTIC> a skos:Concept ;
