    skos:altLabel "statistical outcome" ;
    skos:altLabel "test result value" ;
    skos:definition "A probability measurement information content entity that results from a hypothesis test. This term represents the numerical value calculated during a statistical test. A probability measurement information content entity is defined as the entity that results from a hypothesis test. (Definitional) A hypothesis test results in a probability measurement information content entity. (Procedural/Relational) A probability measurement information content entity that results from a hypothesis test. This value quantifies the outcome of a statistical evaluation." ;
