    skos:altLabel "Security Threat Information" ;
    skos:altLabel "Threat Assessment Data" ;
    skos:altLabel "Risk Information" ;
    skos:altLabel "Vulnerability Information" ;
    skos:definition "An information bearing entity containing details about potential security threats, vulnerabilities, or adverse risk conditions. This entity describes specific threat actors, attack vectors, or system weaknesses that could compromise organizational security. The information serves as foundational data for threat analysis, risk assessment, and security decision-making processes. An information bearing entity is classified as a construct that describes a vulnerability or risk state. The descriptive target of an information bearing entity is either a vulnerability or a risk state. Applies to information entities describing potential security threats, vulnerabilities, or risk states affecting systems and organizations. This term encompasses data used for threat analysis and risk assessment in security operations." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_MATERIAL_ENTITY> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_ICE_DESIGNATIVE_AGENDA_SUBJECT> a skos:Concept ;
