    skos:definition "SocialNetworkingServiceUsage defines a specific instance within a service usage category that denotes the act of using a social networking platform. The relationship between a service usage category and the activity of utilizing a social networking platform is instantiated by SocialNetworkingServiceUsage. SocialNetworkingServiceUsage constitutes a specific instance of a service usage category, denoting the activity of utilizing a social networking platform." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

